  <description>
    <p>Sketch, constrain, extrude. Then build the assembly. PartCraft is part of the CadCraft family: eight free, open-source apps (Apache-2.0) for drafting, modeling, review and takeoff.</p>
    <p>What you can do in PartCraft preview:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Draw your first sketch</li>
      <li>The view cube</li>
      <li>Splines, trim, offset and other sketch tools</li>
      <li>Fully define a sketch with relations and dimensions</li>
      <li>Add sketch geometry by typing coordinates</li>
      <li>Extrude a boss and cut through it</li>
      <li>Revolve a turned part</li>
      <li>Drill holes and counterbores at sketch points</li>
      <li>Reference planes, axes and points</li>
      <li>Pattern and mirror features</li>
      <li>Combine, move and scale bodies; path patterns</li>
      <li>Sweep, loft and draft</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Your files stay on your computer: nothing is uploaded, and the app never contacts getcadcraft.com. Every feature is free, for any work, commercial work included. No account, no sign-in, no ads. Works offline.</p>
    <p>This is an early release (preview). Help is built in, and the help says plainly what is not built yet.</p>
  </description>
